# Logic & Flow Examples (IOGL 1.0)

# 1. Nested Logic Gates
[num1] IN-01 10 @50,50
[num2] IN-01 20 @50,150
[gt] LG-01 GT @300,100
num1.a -> gt.a
num2.a -> gt.b

[btn] IN-05 Sticky @50,250
[and] LG-01 AND @550,180
gt.a -> and.a
btn.a -> and.b

# 2. Logic Switch
[s1] LG-02 @800,180
and.a -> s1.a
num1.a -> s1.b
num2.a -> s1.c
